        </div>
        <div class="overlay-body">
            <h3>Ride with your pack</h3>
            <p>Shurp is a community where empty seats become shared trips — drivers and passengers split the cost of the
                road.</p>
            <h3>Real savings</h3>
            <p>We've ditched platform fees and commissions so every cent stays in your pocket.</p>
            <h3>As easy as it looks</h3>
            <p>Search for your route, message your travel buddy, and settle fuel costs when you meet.</p>
            <h3>Why we don't process payments</h3>
            <p>No commission fees. Settling directly with your driver lets Shurp stay a free tool for everyone. Simple,
                fair, and without middlemen.</p>
            <p class="note">Shurp is a cost-sharing platform, not a commercial transport service. All payments happen
                directly between users.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SEARCHING RIDES -->
    <div class="overlay" id="overlay-search">
        <div class="overlay-bar">
            <button class="back-btn" onclick="closeOverlay('search')">
                <img src="../assets/icons/icon_back.svg" class="icon-primary" alt="back">
            </button>
            <span class="overlay-title">Searching rides</span>
        </div>
        <div class="overlay-body">
            <h3>The classic ride</h3>
            <p>One-on-one — one driver, one route, one seat.</p>
            <h3>Choose from your pack</h3>
            <p>Often several drivers take the same route. Pick from available rides and send your request with one tap.
            </p>
            <h3>How to find a ride</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Start in search</li>
                <li>-> Enter origin and destination</li>
                <li>-> Choose your preferred departure time</li>
                <li>-> Tap Search</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- DRIVING WITH SHURP -->
    <div class="overlay" id="overlay-drive">
        <div class="overlay-bar">
            <button class="back-btn" onclick="closeOverlay('drive')">
                <img src="../assets/icons/icon_back.svg" class="icon-primary" alt="back">
            </button>
            <span class="overlay-title">Driving with Shurp</span>
        </div>
        <div class="overlay-body">
            <h3>One button, all routes</h3>
            <p>Create a one-off ride or all your regular commutes automatically with one tap. Pick the route, days, and
                times you usually drive and add them with one button. Pause or change anytime.</p>
            <h3>Zero commitment, zero stress</h3>
            <p>You only commit when you say yes to an offer. Your car — your rules.</p>
            <h3>Setting the price</h3>
            <p>Shurp calculates a fair cost-sharing amount based on fuel prices and route distance.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SAFETY AND TRUST -->
    <div class="overlay" id="overlay-safety">
        <div class="overlay-bar">
            <button class="back-btn" onclick="closeOverlay('safety')">
                <img src="../assets/icons/icon_back.svg" class="icon-primary" alt="back">
            </button>
            <span class="overlay-title">Safety and trust</span>
        </div>
        <div class="overlay-body">
            <h3>Real IDs, real people</h3>
            <p>Verified drivers are verified through Didit ID driver's licence verification — know who you're riding
                with.</p>
            <h3>Your data is safe</h3>
            <p>Your profile's sensitive data is protected because your privacy isn't up for debate.</p>
            <h3>The "I'm almost there" link</h3>
            <p>Share your location via WhatsApp. Easier to meet up and easier to share with your pack.</p>
            <h3>Good vibes only</h3>
            <p>Our rating system keeps the community great — that's how we reward the legends.</p>
            <h3>The No-Ghosting rule</h3>
            <p>Trust goes both ways. Once a request is confirmed, both sides are committed to a good trip.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ: VERIFICATION -->
    <div class="overlay" id="overlay-faq-ver">
        <div class="overlay-bar">
            <button class="back-btn" onclick="closeOverlay('faq-ver')">
                <img src="../assets/icons/icon_back.svg" class="icon-primary" alt="back">
            </button>
            <span class="overlay-title">Verification &amp; safety</span>
        </div>
        <div class="overlay-body">
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How does driver verification work?<img
                        src="../assets/icons/icon_left_chevron.svg" class="faq-chevron icon-muted"
                        style="transform:rotate(-90deg)" alt=""></div>
                <div class="faq-a">We use Didit ID to verify the driver's licence and identity. After verification,
                    drivers get a badge on their profile. We don't store document numbers, only an encrypted
                    verification
                    status.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Do passengers need to verify?<img
                        src="../assets/icons/icon_left_chevron.svg" class="faq-chevron icon-muted"
                        style="transform:rotate(-90deg)" alt=""></div>
                <div class="faq-a">Passengers don't need ID verification to search for rides. For drivers' peace of mind
                    and a safer community, we also recommend voluntary ID verification for passengers.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What if something goes wrong during a ride?<img
                        src="../assets/icons/icon_left_chevron.svg" class="faq-chevron icon-muted"
                        style="transform:rotate(-90deg)" alt=""></div>
                <div class="faq-a">In an emergency, always contact emergency services. After the trip, use the Report
                    function in the app.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ: PRIVACY -->
