            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Can other users see my personal data?<img
                        src="../assets/icons/icon_left_chevron.svg" class="faq-chevron icon-muted"
                        style="transform:rotate(-90deg)" alt=""></div>
                <div class="faq-a">Your public profile shows only your first name, photo, car info, and rating. Last
                    name
                    and phone are shared only with your confirmed ride partner.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How do I delete my account?<img
                        src="../assets/icons/icon_left_chevron.svg" class="faq-chevron icon-muted"
                        style="transform:rotate(-90deg)" alt=""></div>
                <div class="faq-a">Settings → Account → Delete account. Personal data is permanently deleted. Full
